# steps/table-receiver.md §10: the statement `k: total` at the root of the part
# unit_s7_part_root_src_refused_part.lm2 (harness Parts) is the body of that root's procedure, checked as every
# body is; total is a field of the source, not in the part's scope -- a free name the procedure's callers would
# bind, and it has none: "unresolved name" at the read, in the part.
size_t: total 3U
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
